  "observations": [
    "Before: GUI293 opens a blank unfiltered shortcut table twice even though native data exists; filtering reveals Play/Pause. The new native row-geometry regression fails exactly one case, with14 other cases passing and normal QTest cleanup.",
    "Removing premature uniform row heights restores per-row hints. Fixed native controller/widget suite passes15/0/0. GUI301 first and repeated unfiltered openings show real rows and a scrollbar.",
    "Ordinary duplicate f assignment reports the Fullscreen conflict. Cancel preserves both original mappings and the paused primary clock. Ctrl+Shift+F12 draft survives an owned configuration-path save failure; original config bytes are restored before retry succeeds.",
    "The running instance retains Space and ignores the newly saved shortcut. A new GUI301 instance uses Ctrl+Shift+F12 for actual play/pause and ignores Space. Its shortcut dialog is moved by dragging the title bar while playback stays paused.",
    "Reset saves Space/defaults with truthful restart feedback and preserves every active non-shortcut native option. A fresh traditional-controls instance ignores the removed custom key and actually plays/pauses with Space.",
    "Four ordinary runs exit0/602modules with all source/runtime/base/fixture/cache/producer guards. Three have zero error diagnostics. The failure/retry run retains exactly the expected configuration read error; its strict no-error runner therefore exits1 after the app exits0. This original result is preserved, not rewritten into a zero-error pass."
  ],
