    "Before observation03 has a misleading blank-table name: its filtered Play/Pause row is actually visible. The first and second unfiltered captures establish the blank-table defect.",
    "Owned generated media only. Raw personal logs, isolated profiles/configs, binaries and private media are not included. No security/privacy settings changed. No forced cleanup."
